    {
      "text": "Ar jam reikia naujo palto? Galiu palaukti iki vakaro. Neskubėk, pasakyk, kas tau svarbiausia.",
      "style": "A sincere practical question, followed by patient, attentive reassurance. Natural clear Lithuanian at a measured pace. Dry close-miked speech."
    },
    {
      "text": "Taip, aš čia gyvenu. Tik puodelius vis tiek plaunu pati.",
      "style": "Conversational certainty with a small dry smile on the last sentence; keep the joke understated. Natural clear Lithuanian. Dry close-miked speech."
